cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its recorded results, please cite it as below."
title: "olmoearth_inferenceX: label-free audit of Earth-observation prediction maps"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Qi
    given-names: Ziming
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/2imi9/olmoearth_inferenceX"
url: "https://olmoearth-inferencex.readthedocs.io"
abstract: >-
  Given a prediction map from an Earth-observation model and no labels: which windows a reviewer should
  check first, why each is suspect, and how two inferences of the same scene differ. The model's own top-1
  minus top-2 margin ranks its errors on five kinds of expert reference and on all 24 tasks of the model
  authors' published evaluation suite; every documented number is pinned to a committed artifact.
